// A real sprite, backed by a real loaded image, for frames.id and pixel.id's
// cases: bird.png (games/flappy/art) is 36 rows tall, tall enough for a case
// to sample a source row several past the first without running off the end
// -- unlike the 2x2 fixtures, and cheap enough to decode inside a case's
// memory budget -- unlike the real 2560x2560 sheet tests/unit/spr checks.

spr_native_fixture() {
  png_init();
  png_load("../games/flappy/art/bird.png");
  spr_native_add();
} return void;
